OL,3,ABirmingham and Wales next locations for
OL,4,Agrooming gangs inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has the power to compel individuals
OL,7,Fand institutions to explain what they
OL,8,F"did or did not do to protect children
OL,9,Ffrom being sexually abused", and will
OL,10,Flook at the nature and scale of abuse
OL,11,Fin each area.
OL,13,FLocal investigations have already been
OL,14,Fannounced for Oldham in Greater
OL,15,FManchester, Bradford and Keighley in
OL,16,FWest Yorkshire and London.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
